{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: That sounds rough. How are things going with the new team?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-43/session_1-ba4fd7efba85365c764de71a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:23:35.537518+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ba4fd7efba85365c764de71a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ba4fd7efba85365c764de71a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Things are going well! The team has been really nice and I'm having fun. How's your fan project coming along?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-43/session_1-b434f4520dc20d770374560a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:23:39.651800+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b434f4520dc20d770374560a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b434f4520dc20d770374560a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: It's been going well! Last week I talked to my friend who is a fan of Harry Potter and we're figuring out ideas, so it's been great to get lost in that magical world!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-43/session_1-2519a6ceb9f381a0ea519315", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:23:43.772526+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2519a6ceb9f381a0ea519315", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2519a6ceb9f381a0ea519315", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's great! Loving it when people are passionate about their work. What kind of collaborations are you involved in for the fan project? I love talking to people about my sneaker collection."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-43/session_1-994c177d7b5cb8cecad6fbc5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:23:47.892350+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "994c177d7b5cb8cecad6fbc5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "994c177d7b5cb8cecad6fbc5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! We'll be discussing various aspects of the Harry Potter universe, like characters, spells, and magical creatures. It's great to see fans coming together for this."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-43/session_1-614de29b31b89c9df76eb073", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:23:52.029406+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "614de29b31b89c9df76eb073", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "614de29b31b89c9df76eb073", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow! Have you been to any places related to it?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-43/session_1-741e6c8b51e5191a9a2aec58", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:23:56.165059+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "741e6c8b51e5191a9a2aec58", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "741e6c8b51e5191a9a2aec58", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I went to a place in London a few years ago - it was like walking into a Harry Potter movie! I also went on a tour which was amazing. Have you been to any of the real Potter places? I'd love to explore them someday!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-43/session_1-0dcd3d4ed02c11742d5e5062", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:24:00.304153+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0dcd3d4ed02c11742d5e5062", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0dcd3d4ed02c11742d5e5062", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: No, but it sounds fun! Going to those places is definitely on my to-do list."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-43/session_1-920beba29e03d4f1f0bdd275", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T15:24:04.405631+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "920beba29e03d4f1f0bdd275", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "920beba29e03d4f1f0bdd275", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
